# Smart College Assistant – AI-Based Student Helpdesk

## 🎯 Objectives

- Provide quick college-related information.
- Reduce students' dependency on staff for common queries.
- Automate frequently asked questions.
- Provide a centralized student helpdesk.
- Improve communication between students and college administration.
## 📌 Project Description

Smart College Assistant is an AI-based student helpdesk designed to provide
college-related information quickly and conveniently.

The system uses Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Natural Language Processing
(NLP) to understand student questions and provide relevant answers.

## 🎯 Problem Statement

Students often need information about timetables, examinations, attendance,
assignments, departments, faculty, events, facilities, and complaints.

Usually, students need to contact different departments or staff members,
which can be time-consuming.

This project provides a centralized platform where students can ask questions
and access college information easily.

## ✨ Key Features

- AI Chatbot
- College Information
- Timetable Management
- Exam Information
- Attendance Tracking
- Assignment Support
- Complaint Registration
- Notifications and Announcements
- Faculty and Department Information
- Campus Navigation
- Personalized Assistance
